spec: S14-05, S14-06

The human golden: the CLI prototype's `session-human.txt` in TTY mode (`ANNOTARY_TTY=1`,
color off) — the same verbs as the agent flow print the same fields in the same order, aligned
with a dim header. It continues on the `plan` that `95-agent-flow` left at v5 (Approve by
@rowan, five open Threads) and adds its own `roadmap`. First run and the daemon's `install` are
not replayed (launchd: `make launchd-test`); `daemon status` reads the harness's own `serve`.
`login` signs into the password server (profile `pw`) and `logout` hands it back. `list` and
`token list` filter to this group's own Documents / Members — the store is shared. Ticket 17:
Rowan's push over the agent's v4 is refused with the missing change shown; `merge.sh` puts it in
and the same push lands as v5 (it used to warn and overwrite v4). Merged
stdout+stderr; ids, ages and the Token are random.

